From 97e2e131436628d4ac1da14f7f746806b73c5bd1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 04:00:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/12] test-posix: Check the types, members and prototypes in
 <pwd.h>, <grp.h> and <utmpx.h>

Also that, in strict POSIX mode, <pwd.h> and <grp.h> declare neither
the XSI functions nor extensions, and that no prototype uses a name
an application may have defined as a macro.
---
